Q. What is Elastic Beanstalk (PaaS for App Deployment)?
A:	AWS Elastic Beanstalk is a Platform-as-a-Service (PaaS) that lets you deploy and manage applications without worrying about the infrastructure. (servers, load balancers, scaling, etc.).
You simply upload your code, and Beanstalk automatically handles deployment, from provisioning to monitoring.
Feature
Description
Simplified Deployment
Upload code, Beanstalk does the rest
Auto Scaling
Automatically adjusts compute capacity
Managed Infrastructure
Handles EC2, ELB, Auto Scaling, CloudWatch
Multi-language Support
Java, .NET, Python, PHP, Node.js, Go, Ruby, Docker
Monitoring & Logs
Integrated with CloudWatch for health and metrics
Secure
IAM, VPC, SSL termination support

